Day - 1 (html tags and basics)

html -> hyper text marup language
        type shift 1 and then enter firstly entring
        tags --->
                <html> </html>              starts and ends at the file for an web page
                <p> </P>                    paragraph tag where it shows as the paragraph
                <h1> </h1>                  heding tags where it consists of 6 types as h1 h2 h3 ... till h6 ti cjange only the sizes not the text
                <sup> </sup>                super class where the text can be as a power of the word
                <sub> </sub>                sub class where the text can be as a base of the word
                <u> </u>                    underline tag 
                <b> </b>                    bold tag to get the text as bold
                <big> </big>                makes the text as big size
                <small> </small>            makes the text as the small size
                <i> </i>                    italic to makr the text as the itallic
                <ol> </ol>                  this tag makes as the list if items as the ordered list 
                <ul> </ul>                  this tag makes as the list if items as the unordered list
                <table> </table>            creates a table without any margins this should be coded inside the paragraph tags
                <th> </th>                  this is the tag about the table heading 
                <tr> </tr>                  this tag is about the table row 

